/* Remake-only texts: X(id, French, English, German, Italian, Spanish).
   UTF-8; remake_text() converts them to the fonts' code page (CP437, see
   remake_lang.h), so only the accented letters listed there are drawn.
   Formats keep the same conversions in the same order in every language.
   Button captions (T_BTN_*) are uppercase; "" as a second line means a
   one-line button. The game's own texts (data files) are not here. */

